	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『鉄血のオルフェンズ』より、アグニカ・カイエルの魂が宿るとされる「ガンダム・バエル」がHGシリーズでキット化！",
			"• プロポーションを設定どおりに再現！■可動範囲も広く、マウントした武器に手をかけるなどのポージングも可能！■二刀流を再現できる主要武装も付属する。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Iron-Blooded Orphans\", \"Gundam Bael\", which is said to contain the soul of Agnica Kaiel, is now available as a kit in the HG series!",
			"• Reproduce proportions exactly as you set them! ■The range of movement is wide, and you can pose it by placing your hand on the mounted weapon! ■Main weapons that can reproduce dual-wielding are also included."
		]
	},
